    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d680">

                <pb facs="0662" n="496" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg496"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Swenson </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-10-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 18, 1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Represent to Danish Government the great desirability of deciding at once whether
                    they will make the treaty. We cannot continue negotiations after Congress meets.
                    Ascertain whether offer of a quarter million dollars more will conclude
                    matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
